Package: orbit-apps
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Orbit OS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-gtksource-5,
 gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, rsync, pkexec, libnotify-bin, gvfs, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
Recommends: python3-nautilus, flatpak, orbit-os-branding
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Description: Orbit OS apps
 Orbit Files (file manager), Orbit Notes (Markdown notes), Orbit Spaces,
 Orbit Screenshot (capture and annotate), Orbit Store (curated apps from
 Debian and Flathub), Orbit Hardware (hardware report and guided tests),
 Orbit Backup (rsync snapshot backups), Orbit Updater (updates with
 notifications), Orbit Windows Apps (run .exe and .msi with Wine),
 Orbit Sharing (share folders with Windows PCs), Orbit Sync (folders
 kept the same on all your PCs), Orbit VPN (WireGuard to your own server), Orbit Optimizer (cleanup and
 login apps), Orbit Performance (live load, power mode) and Orbit Games
 (Steam setup, Game Mode, game library), plus a Spaces add-on for GNOME Files.
